{"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"SuperwallKit"}],"title":"devServer","symbolKind":"property","externalID":"s:12SuperwallKit0A7OptionsC9devServerAC03DevE0OSgvp","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"devServer","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DevServer","preciseIdentifier":"s:12SuperwallKit0A7OptionsC9DevServerO","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit","doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/SuperwallOptions"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/SuperwallOptions\/devServer-swift.property","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Connects this SDK instance to a running "},{"code":"superwall dev","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" server, for development builds only."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/superwallkit\/superwalloptions\/devserver-swift.property"]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"tokens":[{"text":"@nonobjc","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"devServer","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12SuperwallKit0A7OptionsC9DevServerO","text":"DevServer","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/SuperwallOptions\/DevServer-swift.enum"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Paywalls with a local counterpart on the dev server then render from your live, local"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"paywall code instead of their published versions, while configuration, placements,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"audience evaluation, assignment and the enforcement of feature gating all stay real."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Paywalls without a local counterpart still load their published versions.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What the local surface owns is what it renders and the settings its "},{"code":"config.ts","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"declares: content, products, presentation style, feature gating, intro offer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"eligibility, scrolling and background colours all come from your local code, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"changing them shows on the next presentation without a push. What "},{"code":"config.ts","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cannot express — surveys, computed properties — comes from the published paywall"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the surface stands in for, and so does any setting your "},{"code":"config.ts","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" leaves out."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A dev server older than this SDK sends no settings at all, in which case every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"setting comes from the published paywall."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Two exceptions. Local notifications are always the local paywall’s: the published","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ones are ignored and the ones your ","type":"text"},{"code":"config.ts","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" declares fire without a push, because","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"they reach the SDK from the paywall itself rather than from the dashboard. And the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on-device cache stays off however either side configures it, so a page you are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"editing is never served from the web view’s cache."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Use ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/SuperwallOptions\/DevServer-swift.enum\/default","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" on a simulator; on a physical device use ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/SuperwallOptions\/DevServer-swift.enum\/url(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with the ","type":"text"},{"code":"Device","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" URL that ","type":"text"},{"code":"superwall dev","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" prints. Defaults to ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": no dev server.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The dev server also activates test mode (simulated purchases, product data from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dashboard), disables paywall preloading, and skips the test mode intro sheet."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The host app must allow local networking in its ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Info.plist"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSAppTransportSecurity"},{"text":" → ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSAllowsLocalNetworking"},{"text":"). That one key covers","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"every address ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"superwall dev"},{"text":" prints: ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"localhost"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".local"},{"text":" hosts, and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"plain IP address in the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Device"},{"type":"text","text":" URL, which App Transport Security stopped"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"permitting by default in iOS 17."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://superwall-ios.SuperwallKit/documentation/SuperwallKit/SuperwallOptions/DevServer-swift.enum":{"title":"SuperwallOptions.DevServer","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/SuperwallOptions\/DevServer-swift.enum","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/superwallkit\/superwalloptions\/devserver-swift.enum","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DevServer","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A running ","type":"text"},{"code":"superwall dev","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" server for ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/SuperwallOptions\/devServer-swift.property","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" to connect to.","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DevServer","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://superwall-ios.SuperwallKit/documentation/SuperwallKit":{"title":"SuperwallKit","url":"\/documentation\/superwallkit","identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"type":"topic","role":"collection"},"doc://superwall-ios.SuperwallKit/documentation/SuperwallKit/SuperwallOptions":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Options for configuring Superwall, including paywall presentation and appearance."}],"url":"\/documentation\/superwallkit\/superwalloptions","identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/SuperwallOptions","role":"symbol","title":"SuperwallOptions","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SuperwallOptions"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SuperwallOptions","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://superwall-ios.SuperwallKit/documentation/SuperwallKit/SuperwallOptions/devServer-swift.property":{"title":"devServer","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/SuperwallOptions\/devServer-swift.property","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/superwallkit\/superwalloptions\/devserver-swift.property","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"devServer","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:12SuperwallKit0A7OptionsC9DevServerO","text":"DevServer","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Connects this SDK instance to a running "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"superwall dev"},{"type":"text","text":" server, for development builds only."}]},"doc://superwall-ios.SuperwallKit/documentation/SuperwallKit/SuperwallOptions/DevServer-swift.enum/url(_:)":{"title":"SuperwallOptions.DevServer.url(_:)","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/SuperwallOptions\/DevServer-swift.enum\/url(_:)","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/superwallkit\/superwalloptions\/devserver-swift.enum\/url(_:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"url"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation3URLV","text":"URL"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The dev server at an exact address — the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Device"},{"type":"text","text":" URL’s origin that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"superwall dev"},{"type":"text","text":" prints, e.g. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"http:\/\/192.168.1.10:6100"},{"type":"text","text":". Use this on a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"physical device, which can’t reach your machine via "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"localhost"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"topic"},"doc://superwall-ios.SuperwallKit/documentation/SuperwallKit/SuperwallOptions/DevServer-swift.enum/default":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Finds the dev server on "},{"code":"localhost","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" ports 6100–6104, which reaches a server"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"running on the same machine from a simulator."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/SuperwallOptions\/DevServer-swift.enum\/default","title":"SuperwallOptions.DevServer.default","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/superwallkit\/superwalloptions\/devserver-swift.enum\/default","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"`default`","kind":"identifier"}]}}}